     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Loans",
     "texto": [
      "**Et lånekort** lets you borrow books from a library. Its definite form is **lånekortet**.",
      "**Lånetid** is the period during which you can keep a loan; **lånefrist** is the deadline for returning it."
     ],
